msgid "This list is used by the firewall (nftables/iptables) to mark traffic to the listed subnets when fake-ip-filter-mode is set to \"whitelist\" or \"rule\". Saving applies changes immediately without restarting Mihomo."
msgstr "当 fake-ip-filter-mode 为“whitelist”或“rule”时，防火墙（nftables/iptables）使用此列表标记发往所列子网的流量。保存后立即生效，无需重启 Mihomo。"

msgid "This block is generated automatically from IP-CIDR entries in providers referenced by non-DIRECT rules. It is refreshed on service start and every clash-rules update (every 30 minutes) only when the configuration or provider data changes."
msgstr "此区域由非 DIRECT 规则引用的 provider 中的 IP-CIDR 条目自动生成。仅当配置或 provider 数据发生变化时，才会在服务启动及每次 clash-rules 更新（每 30 分钟）时刷新。"

